{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21699","headline":"酬乐天闻李尚书拜相以诗见贺 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天闻李尚书拜相以诗见贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初因弹劾死东川，又爲亲情弄化权百口共经三峡水，一时重上两漫天。\n尚书入用虽旬月，司马衔冤已十年。\n若待更遭秋瘴後，便愁平地有重泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}